  "description": "1 Bedroom Apartment (46–52 sq.m)\n\nA spacious one-bedroom home with open-plan living designed around the way you live today. Floor-to-ceiling windows and a generous balcony with outdoor furniture frame the city, coastal and mountain views, opening onto a contemporary two-tone kitchen with solid worktops and integrated Neff appliances. Includes fitted wardrobes, a separate utility room with washer/dryer and additional storage, and a spacious bathroom with terrazzo-effect feature tiling, a dual shower head with rain shower, heated chrome towel rail and large fitted mirror — all finished with interior-designer-curated furnishings.",
